  - parameter: T=100 K, kappa=1 cm2/g at 1.3 mm, R_dg=0.01, d=3.1 kpc, mu=2.33, alpha 0.1-1, v_ff=6 km/s, l=500 au [Replenishing times: "We use a single temperature of 100 K for the central source and streamers"]
